<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Pawnee - 115,000 tonnes coal Richards Bay/Rotterdam $6.85 fio scale load/25,000 shinc April-May Cobelfret.</p>
<p>Iron Master - 105,000 tonnes coal Baltimore/Ensted $6.25 fio 35,000 shinc/35,000 shinc 20-30/4 Elsam.</p>
<p>Orfeas - 100,000 tonnes coal Richards Bay/Antwerp $7.70 fio scale load/25,000 shinc May Cobelfret.</p>
<p>ORE - Tomis Faith - 65,000 tonnes ore Port Hedland/Kaohsiung $5.90 fio 48,000 shinc/38,000 shinc 15-25/4 China Steel.</p>
</text>
